---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="Contact" description={`Contact ${site.name} about a download, a print problem, or a coloring set you want next.`} path="/contact/">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Write to us</h1>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. There is no account and no comment box. That is deliberate: this is a printable library, not a place for children to post.</p>
    <p>Useful notes include the page you were on, whether you wanted US Letter or A4, and what the printer did. If you want a set that is not here yet, name the theme and the age. Ages 2–3 are huge shapes. Ages 3–4 are animals, dinosaurs, cars, and princesses. Ages 4–5 are a garden or a chunky vehicle. Ages 5–6 are ocean scenes or patterned dinosaurs. Ages 6–8 are town scenes or woodland animals. Fall, Halloween, and Christmas each have a page split by those same ages.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
